---
source: tests/human_output.rs
description: "Auth status with a key the API rejects: the local lines, then the error, exit 1."
---
$ dn auth status
API key: DEFINED_API_KEY (raw value in environment)
API URL: <API_URL>
--- stderr
error: Defined API error (HTTP 401)   ERR_UNAUTHORIZED: invalid API key
--- exit 1
